<title>UK: LucasVarity down after analysts meeting.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity down after analysts meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in LucasVarity Plc dropped in late trading on Tuesday after comments to analysts by company executives, reversing earlier gains after the company detailed restructuring plans.</p>
<p>The stock was down 13p at 237-1/2 by 1550 GMT, after earlier rising as high as 263p.</p>
